+---
+id: task-002-fix-coupon-base-after-volume-discount-and-coupon-last-day-expiry-flag-shipping-vat
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base after volume discount and coupon last-day expiry; flag shipping VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+1. Percentage coupon must apply to the subtotal after volume discounts (12 x EUR 5.00, 10% coupon -> EUR 48.60). Fixed in `src/pricing.ts`.
+2. Coupon is valid through its last day (README: both days included); AUTUMN on 30 Nov was refused. Fixed in `src/coupons.ts`.
+3. Shipping VAT: NOT changed. README says shipping is subject to 22% VAT on its own receipt line and the README is authoritative; the request contradicts it. Needs a product decision (and a README change) first.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts` (last day / day after, 9 vs 12 units with coupon).
